t a more rounded perspective.\n\n6. **Support and Resources**: If the transgender individual feels unfairly judged, they might benefit from support or resources that can help them address any concerns the parents have raised.\n\nUltimately, the decision should be made in the best interest of the children, ensuring their safety, well-being, and positive development."}
