ls natural to her, such as sharing a related experience or suggesting a distraction like an outing.\n\nUltimately, it\u2019s important for both George and Elizabeth to remember that their friend likely appreciates their efforts to be there during a difficult time. Each person can contribute to the support in their own way, and Elizabeth's presence alone is valuable."}
