ion:** Donna is assessing how the candidate handles challenges, interacts with others, and fits within the team dynamic.\n\nBy combining technical and behavioral assessments, Joseph and Donna aim to get a comprehensive view of the candidate's overall suitability for the role. This dual approach helps ensure that the candidate is not only technically proficient but also a good cultural fit for the company."}
