ments?\"\n     - **Motivation and Goals:** \"What motivates you in your work, and where do you see yourself in five years?\"\n\n3. **Overall Evaluation:**\n   - **Technical Proficiency:** Steven will evaluate the candidate's technical responses and problem-solving skills.\n   - **Cultural Fit and Soft Skills:** Barbara will assess how well the candidate's values and working style align with the company culture.\n   - **Collaborative Discussion:** Steven and Barbara may discuss their impressions to reach a consensus on the candidate's suitability for the role.\n\nBy combining technical and behavioral assessments, Steven and Barbara aim to select a well-rounded candidate who not only has the necessary technical skills but also fits well within the team and company culture."}
