ria assesses the candidate's technical abilities to ensure they have the necessary skills for the role.\n- **Cultural Fit**: Joseph evaluates whether the candidate's values and behavior align with the company's culture and team dynamics.\n- **Comprehensive View**: Together, they aim to get a well-rounded view of the candidate's capabilities, both technically and personally, to make an informed hiring decision."}
