ny challenges, and provide constructive feedback.\n\n5. **Peer Support**: Pair Ruth with Brian for certain tasks, allowing her to benefit from his confidence and leadership. This can be a learning opportunity for her to observe and emulate effective work habits.\n\nBy tailoring your approach to the strengths and needs of each intern, you can help both Brian and Ruth succeed in their roles and develop valuable skills for their future careers."}
